        {
          "text": "Banyama bamusokwe bayoondilemeka. Bamwaaba ampoo, boonse bayookoodwa nkaambo kakuti ndabapa maanzi munkanda amilonga mumabuwa­, kuti nywisye bantu bangu basalidwe, ",
